# ZeroDev smart accounts (passkey + Google social login, cross-chain deposits)
# Get a free project id at https://dashboard.zerodev.app
# Without it the smart-account login options stay hidden and everything else is unchanged.
# NOTE: Google social login works on localhost in dev mode; a public deployment
# needs Social Auth approved on the ZeroDev dashboard (Growth plan + own Google OAuth client).
NEXT_PUBLIC_ZERODEV_PROJECT_ID=
